---
// An outlet's words, quoted. The marks are drawn softer than the words, and the opening
// one hangs in the margin, so the words start on the edge of the column they stand in.
// Both marks stay in the text: read aloud, copied or printed, it is still a quotation.
---

<span class="quote-mark open">“</span><slot /><span class="quote-mark">”</span>
